<title>USA: Yields rise on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</title>
<headline>Yields rise on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on all three of the Bond Buyer municipal bond indices rose this week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 20-bond index of general obligation bonds calculated Thursday was 5.53 percent, up five basis points from last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 11-bond index of GO bonds was 5.44 percent, up five basis points.</p>
<p>The yield on the 30-year revenue bond index was 5.82 percent, up 10.</p>
<p>					Latest Previous Last Date</p>
<p>20 Bond Index			5.53%    5.48%  6/26/97</p>
<p>11 Bond index			5.44%    5.39%  6/26/97</p>
<p>Revenue Bond Index		 5.82%    5.72%  6/26/97</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
